{%- comment -%}
  Hartwick Atelier — image or labelled placeholder.

  Every homepage image is a placeholder until Angela's asset folder arrives (risk R4).
  The label is drawn from the wireframe's own slot names, so a placeholder is never
  mistaken for finished art, and the aspect ratio is reserved by the caller's class
  so the layout does not shift when the real image lands.

  Usage:
    {% render 'ha-figure',
         image: section.settings.image,
         label: section.settings.image_label,
         class: 'ha-hero__figure',
         sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 58vw, 100vw',
         loading: 'eager' %}

  `asset` (15 Sep 2026): a provisional photograph shipped INSIDE the theme
  (assets/…jpg), used only while no image has been picked. The About page
  wireframe arrived with its photographs baked into the drawing and the
  re-edited originals not yet to hand; the theme cannot write to Admin >
  Files, so the stand-ins live in assets/ and the picker still wins the moment
  a real file is chosen. `asset_img_url` gives the CDN's resized copies, so
  the fallback is as responsive as the picked image would be. `asset_w` /
  `asset_h` are the file's pixel size, for the browser's aspect reservation.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign fig_class = class | default: ''
  assign fig_sizes = sizes | default: '100vw'
  assign fig_loading = loading | default: 'lazy'
  assign fig_alt = alt | default: ''
  assign has_media = false
  if image
    assign has_media = true
  elsif asset != blank
    assign has_media = true
  endif
-%}

<figure class="ha-figure {{ fig_class }}{% unless has_media %} ha-figure--empty{% endunless %}">
  {%- if image -%}
    {{
      image
      | image_url: width: 2400
      | image_tag:
        loading: fig_loading,
        sizes: fig_sizes,
        widths: '400, 600, 800, 1000, 1200, 1600, 2000, 2400',
        alt: fig_alt
    }}
  {%- elsif asset != blank -%}
    <img
      src="{{ asset | asset_img_url: '1600x' }}"
      srcset="{{ asset | asset_img_url: '600x' }} 600w, {{ asset | asset_img_url: '1000x' }} 1000w, {{ asset | asset_img_url: '1600x' }} 1600w, {{ asset | asset_img_url: '2400x' }} 2400w"
      sizes="{{ fig_sizes }}"
      loading="{{ fig_loading }}"
      alt="{{ fig_alt | escape }}"
      width="{{ asset_w | default: 1600 }}"
      height="{{ asset_h | default: 1600 }}"
    >
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if label != blank -%}
    <figcaption class="ha-figure__label ha-record">{{ label }}</figcaption>
  {%- endif -%}
</figure>
